# Router Endpoint README Sync

When changing API endpoints in `app/routers/`, also update `app/routers/README.md` in the same change.

## Required updates

- Add README entries for new endpoints.
- Remove README entries for deleted endpoints.
- Rename or adjust method/path entries for changed endpoints.
- Update the short description when endpoint behavior changes significantly.

## What counts as endpoint changes

- `@router.get(...)`, `@router.post(...)`, `@router.put(...)`, `@router.patch(...)`, `@router.delete(...)`
- Router prefix changes that alter full endpoint paths
- Path parameter changes (for example `{id}` renamed)
